// 2011's rocks. 289 knows the 2005 rocks only; 2011 re-modelled most mining
// sites with rocks of their own. Every rock void-634 lists (rocks.objs.toml)
// whose op1 in the 647 cache is Mine joins its ore's mining_table row, with
// void's depleted form (void depletes `<ore>_rocks_<site>_<n>` to
// `depleted_rocks_<site>_<n>`). Iron is fast as in 289; gem rocks have a
// category of their own, since 2011 has several.

